{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_7_level_main_07-06_beg","groupId":"main_7","stageId":"main_07-06","title":"沉默者之怒-1","storyCode":"7-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"34f94259af86da40b7690b70c654786698651d0f39347ff4c1e6a8b11df2c394","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"核心城內，歸來的幻影弩手被塔露拉背棄。\n另一邊，羅德島一行一邊增進對敵人的瞭解，一邊緩慢而確實地向前推進著。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"11:30 a.m."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_perimeter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"領袖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"幻影弩手們。很高興見到你們平安歸來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的隊伍很浩大。他們都是龍門的同胞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"有許多感染者......和我們一起回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到會在這裡遇到你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"充分利用切爾諾伯格的資源，能拯救許多人。這座核心城將是我們攻破龍門的利器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？不，不對，領袖......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼龍門的情況和計畫裡說的完全不一樣？我們多少戰友平白無故地在那裡送了命！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼敢這樣對領袖......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"不。他說得對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可敬的同胞們已經受了太多的苦。我們的作戰計畫也因為敵人奸詐的圈套，受到了很大的挫折。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，即使我們的先鋒遭遇了一時的阻礙，整合運動卻還依然有為你們報仇的決心。你們的創傷，你們的犧牲，我會為你們討回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"請放心，我一直與你們在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......希望是這樣，領袖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你背著的怎麼是......梅菲斯特？他沒有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德是不是為了救他犧牲了自己？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......確實如此，領袖。浮士德不顧自己的命，用法術掩蓋了我們所有人的蹤跡，把逃出來的機會......讓給了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"幻影弩手們，整合運動的同胞們......我們會永遠懷念浮士德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"扶他下去吧。梅菲斯特也許需要一點時間去休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我會讓戰士們領你們去現在的駐地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，領袖......我們很早就失去了弑君者的消息，我們不確定她的下落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"至於......雪怪小隊，以及霜星小姐，他們都......都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"真是無比令人沉痛的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"請允許我......獨處一小會兒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_perimeter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲。不要讓他們和任何城內的整合運動成員接觸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"做到哪一步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"最後一步。永遠不要。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"是刻意隱瞞，還是鑽研得出了成果？他的小隊竟然知道我不瞭解的資訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"也許......是在戰鬥中有了成長。這樣的法術已經超乎尋常，而他對我守口如瓶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......沉默寡言竟然成了偽裝的外皮。本以為存活的會是浮士德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是這樣，那也就不奇怪了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherbefore_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你是誰？"},{"type":"narration","text":"我是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想做什麼？"},{"type":"narration","text":"我想做什麼......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"加入......你們？為了自己去鬥爭？"},{"type":"narration","text":"鬥爭......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，崇高的烏薩斯人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"原本你們才是應該走到最後的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"核心城似乎恢復速度了，停駐的時間不長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"往好的方向想，整合運動應該還是接收了一部分從龍門遷移出來的感染者。希望如此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們也可能被迫改變策略。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"可預見的是，核心城還會在路途中停留幾次，直到敵人的指揮官不再打算掩蓋自己的動機，拒絕感染者難民為止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果魏彥吾選擇類似的時機展開進攻，敵人會改變現有防衛力量的佈置，我們很可能會因此暴露位置，成為眾矢之的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"希望那個協定起碼能讓文月小姐把魏長官拖上一會兒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我們已經相當接近核心城的中央區了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"大量在地下與地面上穿行的通道，似乎原本是核心城的資源輸送系統的一部分。天災過後，所有工業設施都停止了運作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"在這種情況下，核心城居然還能運作，甚至移動......這和凱爾希醫生說的地下設施有關嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，穿梭通道為我們提供了良好的隱蔽。在這個接近中央區的倉儲區域內，敵人的守衛數量已經增加了近一倍......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"進入核心城以來，我們還沒有遭遇太多火力衝突。但在踏入中央區之後，我們與整合運動摩擦、甚至交戰的次數，應該會急劇增加。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"偵察小隊與行動小隊已經先我們一步到位。迄今為止都很順利。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們怎麼只有三支小隊共同行動？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"偵察小隊和特別行動小隊有他們各自的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"作為羅德島的通訊專家之一，Raidian在這次行動中領導偵察小隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"依靠Raidian，偵察小隊在核心城作戰中發揮著通訊中繼點的作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使在這裡，我們也能與其他隊伍交流，這全部仰賴這支小隊的努力。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我沒看見他們......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"偵察小隊從來都獨來獨往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Outcast，Raidian，以及在切城營救行動中英勇犧牲的Scout——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"擔任偵察小隊隊長的精英幹員們，擔負著獨自領導一支小隊，發現危機，報告危機，以及嘗試獨自處理危機的職責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian不像剛才提到的另兩位精英幹員那樣擅長戰鬥，但在影響戰局的層面上，卻可以稱作是在羅德島屈指可數的人才。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這一次的攻擊任務由我們這三支隊伍承擔，Raidian不必再承擔繁重的戰鬥事務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"至於特別小隊，他們的任務與正面作戰無關。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"和我說說。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"所以你不準備告訴我？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"知道有其必要即可。更多細節你之後自然會明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不同的小隊是戰略計畫鏈條上不同的環節，穩固的結構輸出穩定的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"相應的，強韌的敵手也一樣有著錯綜複雜的根部，它會從各個不同的層面吸取養分，砍掉枝條對他們並無威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要做的是在暗處引燃敵人根基。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"啊？你說什麼？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我似乎明白了。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。理應不存在你不能理解的事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“博士”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"等一等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"遠處有幾個很模糊的感覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"很整齊，流向沒有變化，沒有相互衝突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......很硬。在移動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動的......守衛部隊。先避開他們，尋找其他可以通過的道路......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"事不宜遲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"慎重。你沒有感受到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"諸位幹員......戴上防護裝置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......難道......迷迭香？你有察覺到什麼異常嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？......沒有吧。我想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是迷迭香源石技藝作用的範疇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不要完全依賴情感，阿米婭。知覺不僅能摸索到感情，手指劃過髮絲，第一感覺不應該是留戀或者喜悅。表象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"表象......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，你可以從深色的內裡回到表象。只有你才能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就按醫生說的，試一試。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......好像有一絲......能量。空氣中彌漫著一種氣味，像是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......屍體？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這不是現實的屍體，難道......不。啊？為什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......是薩卡茲。是薩卡茲的源石技藝。蘊含死亡氣味的......儀......式？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"成型後自運行的古老儀式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——這不是現代的法術，更不屬於現代戰術。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"薩卡茲的法術很不同？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。這很不一般。現在的薩卡茲人沒法推動這種法術的運行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白凱爾希醫生的意思。我想，這不是在現代成型的源石技藝理論的產物。這是古老的薩卡茲儀式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人可能是最“純正”的薩卡茲。這種現代國家不可能使用的技術，只在古老的薩卡茲與散漫的薩爾貢古人間流傳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......這是依託於礦石病感染，以及施術者對源石的異樣理解來施行的儀式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"雜亂的能量正自源石核心處向外滲透、漫溢出去，籠罩在這個街區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"難以想像儀式源頭高濃度的法術漩渦會對生物產生多大影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是對自己還是對敵人......生命活動的跡象都會被能量波逐漸曳離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這並不符合現代戰術的需求，帶來的損失有時候會比可能取得的戰果還大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“食人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這個說法聳人聽聞，只是，這個儀式確實被這樣稱呼過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"參照它恐怖的殺傷力和不諳內情者將之稱為“巫術”的行為，把發生裝置叫作祭壇，也不奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不覺得普通的薩卡茲雇傭兵能使用這種法術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只有在卡茲戴爾汲取法術知識和戰爭經驗的人，才有可能成功施行這種儀式，實施者甚至不用是個術師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但他......他只會是卡茲戴爾的薩卡茲，而不是流浪在大地各處的薩卡茲後裔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......凱爾希醫生，第二套防護裝置，是不是設計來抵消這種薩卡茲法術的影響的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不完全是。儀式蘊含的能量遠超我們設計所能承受的最大限度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"正是在這片遭天災洗劫的城市上，這種儀式才能順利運行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的防護不能抵消敵人儀式的影響，這個法術的威力與它的古老程度無法分割。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只能稍微削減它的殺傷力，在掃清整片區域後破壞它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的儀式往往不只是在挑戰一種現代技術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"它幾乎是要重新挑戰這片大地上的其它文明，就像歷史上薩卡茲們謀劃過的一樣。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這是個比喻。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是。但薩卡茲的歷史不是比喻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"守衛切爾諾伯格核心城不只是普通的整合運動，這點我已經和你討論過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"也許整合運動確實依靠“神經網路”中的各個“中樞”來進行大規模的整體運作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在如今這種純粹的推進戰略中，整合運動將一反常態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"想想看，如果是不擅長對抗感染者的士兵，不知道如何與薩卡茲戰鬥的現代武裝進入了核心城......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"他們將在這裡慘敗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼......我想一想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......Dr.{@nickname}，凱爾希醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人施行薩卡茲法術的位置，一定是重要據點，或是交通要道的樞紐處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"他們比我們更熟悉這片區域，所有我們可通行的路徑，他們會比我們更早發現......他們的佈防一定早於我們的行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們擁有的唯一優勢，就是情報。我們已經瞭解了敵人的分佈，敵人卻對我們一無所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以我們要迅速擊潰據守在這片區域裡的敵人。用時越少，我們越安全。不要讓他們有聯繫其他守衛的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"放棄伏擊敵人的想法。我們不能在這裡浪費過多時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"可以，我會幫助你們進行突襲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，嗯......我想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生，你看，我想，如果是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們不需要我的協助，Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"嗯？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"有什麼我能幫上忙的？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"請你幫助阿米婭指揮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"戰況就由你們自己判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香，我們行動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"在這次戰鬥之後，我們就要徹底離開穿梭區域，完全抵達核心城地表了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香......至少有陽光了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"陽光~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"（呵，看她們的樣子。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"（接下來就交給你了，Dr.{@nickname}。我知道，你絕不讓人失望。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希，讓人失望的事情是不會再次發生的。\n同樣的河流我們沒法踏入第二次。同樣的事情也不會發生第二次。\n如果是相同的人，相同的事......在不同的時代裡，一定會有不一樣的結果。這片大地......會被改變。\n你不相信，對嗎？\n嗯......你不相信，也是應該的。\n但我很相信。Dr.{@nickname}，這樣一個人......我知道......如果不是現在，Dr.{@nickname}不會這樣。\n我看過那麼多，見過那麼多......哪怕所有人都拒絕，我也能理解。\n凱爾希......凱爾希。\n如果......再給我們一點時間......我和你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"（你能證明自己不是流連於過往的Dr.{@nickname}。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果是現在......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"（無論哪個層面，Dr.{@nickname}。你必須能。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["塔露拉"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動成員"]}]}
